#
# Wineglass rings 🍷 at bodymind altitude per Reed HARD RULE
# `feedback_alex_phenomenologizes_reeds_mechanical_names` — the
# Asimov 1942 Foundation term carries the right association
# (state spaces + possibilities) at compiler-substrate altitude.
# Asimov naming-lineage EXPLICITLY RATIFIED phenomenological at
# family-root altitude. `figment` surfaced as alternative-direction
# but rejected in favor of Asimov's stronger state-space-and-
